config BR2_PACKAGE_FEATURE_TSN
	bool "Feature TSN"
	help
	  Time-sensitive networking shapers on switch ports: the IEEE
	  802.1Qav credit-based shaper and the IEEE 802.1Qbv time-aware
	  shaper, modelled by the IEEE 802.1DC interface modules.  Select
	  on products whose switch driver offloads the cbs and taprio
	  queueing disciplines.
